data: {"messages":[{"content":"请测试 `analyze-video` skill 的 Agent 真链路。\n\n必须严格执行：\n1. 先调用 read_file 读取 `/mnt/skills/custom/analyze-video/SKILL.md`。\n2. 再调用 bash 执行下面这段命令，不要改路径，不要省略任何输出文件。\n3. 执行完成后读取 `/mnt/user-data/outputs/analyze-video/result.json`，并在最终回复中返回这个 JSON 的内容和简短结论。\n\n```bash\nmkdir -p /mnt/user-data/outputs/analyze-video/artifacts\npython /mnt/skills/custom/analyze-video/scripts/extract_frames.py /mnt/datasets/Vedio-demo/Trafic.mp4 --output-dir /mnt/user-data/outputs/analyze-video/artifacts/video_review --coarse-fps 0.2 --dense-fps 1 --scene-threshold 0.3 --dense-window 1 --max-frames 12 > /mnt/user-data/outputs/analyze-video/result.json\n```\n\n成功判定：必须能看到 read_file 读取该 SKILL.md、bash 执行该 skill 入口、并生成 `/mnt/user-data/outputs/analyze-video/result.json`。","additional_kwargs":{},"response_metadata":{},"type":"human","name":null,"id":"27821914-d262-4971-98d6-696ce8a14721"},{"content":"我将按照您的要求严格执行测试流程。\n\n**步骤 1：读取 SKILL.md 文件**\n\n","additional_kwargs":{"refusal":null},"response_metadata":{"token_usage":{"completion_tokens":124,"prompt_tokens":9030,"total_tokens":9154,"completion_tokens_details":{"accepted_prediction_tokens":null,"audio_tokens":null,"reasoning_tokens":40,"rejected_prediction_tokens":null,"text_tokens":124},"prompt_tokens_details":{"audio_tokens":null,"cached_tokens":null,"text_tokens":9030}},"model_provider":"openai","model_name":"qwen3.5-plus","system_fingerprint":null,"id":"chatcmpl-341f8d48-f15e-900f-81d7-65e06b3083fc","finish_reason":"tool_calls","logprobs":null},"type":"ai","name":null,"id":"lc_run--019e6290-a35b-7e62-a0cb-84fd46abec49-0","tool_calls":[{"name":"read_file","args":{"description":"读取 analyze-video skill 的 SKILL.md 文件","path":"/mnt/skills/custom/analyze-video/SKILL.md"},"id":"call_e4f8387ad78742d78ff0b464","type":"tool_call"}],"invalid_tool_calls":[],"usage_metadata":{"input_tokens":9030,"output_tokens":124,"total_tokens":9154,"input_token_details":{},"output_token_details":{"reasoning":40}}},{"content":"---\nname: analyze-video\ndescription: 专业视频抽帧与取证准备技能。支持场景检测、多阶段帧提取和 metadata 生成，供 single-video-event-analysis 做 LLM 审帧使用；本 skill 不再作为最终事件检测入口。\nversion: 1.0.0\nauthor: jdrodriguez\ncompatibility: \">=2.0.0\"\nallowed-tools:\n  - bash\n  - read_file\n  - write_file\n---\n\n# 专业视频抽帧取证准备技能 (Analyze Video)\n\n## Execution Priority\n\nPrioritize calling this skill's `scripts/extract_frames.py` entrypoint to produce timestamped frames and metadata. For final event detection, use `single-video-event-analysis`.\n\n## 技能说明\n`analyze-video` 是一个高精度的视频抽帧和取证准备工具。它通过 `ffmpeg` 在本地执行场景变更检测，并自动将长视频划分为多个“章节”，为后续 LLM 审帧提供可回放、可审计的帧证据。\n\n## 核心能力\n- **自动分段**：自动识别视频中的重要场景并进行章节切分。\n- **自适应抓图**：在场景剧烈变化处自动增加抓拍频率，确保不遗漏关键动作。\n- **审帧准备**：输出便于 LLM 审查的帧目录和 `metadata.json`。\n- **结构化帧元数据**：为每一帧生成精确的时间戳和元数据。\n\n## 触发关键词\n- \"视频抽帧\", \"场景检测\", \"关键帧提取\", \"取证准备\", \"视频回溯\", \"analyze-video\", \"metadata.json\"\n\n## 权限声明\n- `bash`: 用于执行 `python3 /mnt/skills/custom/analyze-video/scripts/extract_frames.py`。\n- `ffmpeg`: 核心依赖。\n\n## 操作规范 (Guidelines)\n1. **工作流程**：\n   - 调用：`python3 /mnt/skills/custom/analyze-video/scripts/extract_frames.py <video_path> --output-dir /mnt/user-data/workspace/video_review`。\n   - 读取产生的 `metadata.json` 了解视频章节、场景变化和帧分布。\n   - 如需最终事件检测，交给 `single-video-event-analysis` 统一完成。\n2. **注意事项**：\n   - 提取过程可能耗时较长（视视频长度而定）。\n   - 本 skill 不输出最终事件类型、事件置信度或人工复核结论。\n\n## 示例 (Example)\n**用户：** \"把 `/mnt/datasets/surveillance/raw/test_video_01.mp4` 抽帧用于取证。\"\n**Agent 动作：**\n- 执行：`python3 /mnt/skills/custom/analyze-video/scripts/extract_frames.py /mnt/datasets/surveillance/raw/test_video_01.mp4`\n- 根据输出的 `output_dir` 读取元数据。\n- 回复用户： \"视频提取完成，共识别出 3 个关键场景，可交给 single-video-event-analysis 做事件审查。\"\n","additional_kwargs":{},"response_metadata":{},"type":"tool","name":"read_file","id":"2d0ebb8b-ca3d-4ff3-a5d0-54d00fd65f8b","tool_call_id":"call_e4f8387ad78742d78ff0b464","artifact":null,"status":"success"},{"content":"**步骤 2：执行 bash 命令**\n\n","additional_kwargs":{"refusal":null},"response_metadata":{"token_usage":{"completion_tokens":165,"prompt_tokens":9777,"total_tokens":9942,"completion_tokens_details":{"accepted_prediction_tokens":null,"audio_tokens":null,"reasoning_tokens":0,"rejected_prediction_tokens":null,"text_tokens":165},"prompt_tokens_details":{"audio_tokens":null,"cached_tokens":null,"text_tokens":9777}},"model_provider":"openai","model_name":"qwen3.5-plus","system_fingerprint":null,"id":"chatcmpl-bd64bd8a-b522-9b91-bf04-118796f1d54d","finish_reason":"tool_calls","logprobs":null},"type":"ai","name":null,"id":"lc_run--019e6290-c96d-7701-90c3-3eee8e84ab60-0","tool_calls":[{"name":"bash","args":{"description":"执行 analyze-video skill 的 extract_frames.py 脚本","command":"mkdir -p /mnt/user-data/outputs/analyze-video/artifacts && python /mnt/skills/custom/analyze-video/scripts/extract_frames.py /mnt/datasets/Vedio-demo/Trafic.mp4 --output-dir /mnt/user-data/outputs/analyze-video/artifacts/video_review --coarse-fps 0.2 --dense-fps 1 --scene-threshold 0.3 --dense-window 1 --max-frames 12 > /mnt/user-data/outputs/analyze-video/result.json"},"id":"call_9b26c28ce79c4746baf1b256","type":"tool_call"}],"invalid_tool_calls":[],"usage_metadata":{"input_tokens":9777,"output_tokens":165,"total_tokens":9942,"input_token_details":{},"output_token_details":{"reasoning":0}}},{"content":"Video: /mnt/datasets/Vedio-demo/Trafic.mp4\nOutput: /mnt/user-data/outputs/analyze-video/artifacts/video_review\nReading video metadata...\n  Duration: 0:15:00.920 (900.9s)\n  FPS: 12.0\n  Resolution: 1280x674\n  Codec: h264\n  File size: 72.4 MB\nPass 0: Scene detection (threshold=0.3)...\n  Detected 0 scene changes.\nPass 1: Coarse sweep at 0.2 fps...\n  WARNING: Coarse pass alone would produce 181 frames (limit: 12). Reducing effective duration.\n  Chapter 1/4: 60 frames (0:00:00.000 - 0:05:00.000)\n  Max frames limit (12) reached. Stopping coarse pass.\n  Coarse pass complete: 12 frames.\nPass 2: No scene changes -- skipping dense extraction.\n\nExtraction complete in 8.5s:\n  Total frames: 12\n  Scene changes: 0\n  Chapters: 4\n  Passes: scene_detect, coarse, dense\n  Output: /mnt/user-data/outputs/analyze-video/artifacts/video_review\n  Metadata: /mnt/user-data/outputs/analyze-video/artifacts/video_review/metadata.json\n  WARNING: Frame limit (12) was reached. Some frames may have been skipped.","additional_kwargs":{},"response_metadata":{},"type":"tool","name":"bash","id":"12a71c3b-6dc6-4681-9a57-561b0a18d292","tool_call_id":"call_9b26c28ce79c4746baf1b256","artifact":null,"status":"success"},{"content":"**步骤 3：读取生成的 result.json 文件**\n\n","additional_kwargs":{"refusal":null},"response_metadata":{"token_usage":{"completion_tokens":73,"prompt_tokens":10299,"total_tokens":10372,"completion_tokens_details":{"accepted_prediction_tokens":null,"audio_tokens":null,"reasoning_tokens":0,"rejected_prediction_tokens":null,"text_tokens":73},"prompt_tokens_details":{"audio_tokens":null,"cached_tokens":null,"text_tokens":10299}},"model_provider":"openai","model_name":"qwen3.5-plus","system_fingerprint":null,"id":"chatcmpl-32b38116-8cd1-9b4d-9aa7-025c144ac8d2","finish_reason":"tool_calls","logprobs":null},"type":"ai","name":null,"id":"lc_run--019e6290-ff63-7461-bc17-0eff2867e73c-0","tool_calls":[{"name":"read_file","args":{"description":"读取 analyze-video skill 生成的 result.json 结果文件","path":"/mnt/user-data/outputs/analyze-video/result.json"},"id":"call_ee28b1647b4a470ba02c6a72","type":"tool_call"}],"invalid_tool_calls":[],"usage_metadata":{"input_tokens":10299,"output_tokens":73,"total_tokens":10372,"input_token_details":{},"output_token_details":{"reasoning":0}}},{"content":"{\"status\": \"success\", \"output_dir\": \"/mnt/user-data/outputs/analyze-video/artifacts/video_review\", \"metadata\": \"/mnt/user-data/outputs/analyze-video/artifacts/video_review/metadata.json\", \"total_frames\": 12, \"total_scene_changes\": 0, \"chapters\": 4, \"video_duration\": 900.92, \"passes\": [\"scene_detect\", \"coarse\", \"dense\"]}\n","additional_kwargs":{},"response_metadata":{},"type":"tool","name":"read_file","id":"de57504d-57a2-4a49-8119-50d863019447","tool_call_id":"call_ee28b1647b4a470ba02c6a72","artifact":null,"status":"success"}],"thread_data":{"workspace_path":"/app/backend/.deer-flow/threads/a4f8d126-c42d-4f2f-871f-032723e4ca2c/user-data/workspace","uploads_path":"/app/backend/.deer-flow/threads/a4f8d126-c42d-4f2f-871f-032723e4ca2c/user-data/uploads","outputs_path":"/app/backend/.deer-flow/threads/a4f8d126-c42d-4f2f-871f-032723e4ca2c/user-data/outputs"},"viewed_images":{},"artifacts":[]}

